LX DECOMPRESSES ONLY:

Sample Lx Decompress to ram:

          LX X file.lha ram:

Extract all files starting with 'boing' to ram:

          LX X file.lzh ram: BOING*

Extract all archivves ending in lzh or lha on df1: to Current Dir

          LX X df1:#?

Test all files in archive

          LX T file.lzh

LIST OR VIEW CONTENTS OF FILES

          LX L file.lzh
          LX V file.lzh
